Bugfix: Label the domain and group name input fields

Two input fields of the settings UI had no label at all. Their only description
was a placeholder, which disappears with the first keystroke, is low contrast by
design and is not a persistent programmatic label. Anyone returning to a
partially filled field has no way left to tell what belongs in it.

Both fields now carry a visually hidden label, using the existing utility class
and the already translated strings. The placeholder is kept as an additional
hint.

WCAG 2.1 AA, SC 3.3.2
